OL,5,G1750 The Dog House Australia
OL,6,     FUntil recently, the Bankens were
OL,7,     Fhomeless. Now the family want a
OL,8,     Fdog to make their new house a
OL,9,     Fhome. Meg and Matt are smitten
OL,10,     Fwith Travis; is the feeling
OL,11,     Fmutual?
OL,12,G1850 The Dog House
